# ============================================================
# ZhuangZhou (庄周) — Root .gitignore
# Created by RC Gate-0 (G0-2) on 2026-08-13.
#
# Scope: Git hygiene boundary.
#   TRACKED (kept): source, config templates, LICENSE, README,
#   release docs, tests, static assets.
#   IGNORED: secrets, local env, user data, runtime DB (+ backups),
#   logs, temp, cache, managed runtimes (node_modules/python/models),
#   build/dist artifacts, IDE/OS files.
#
# NOTE: zhuangzhou-ui/ has its OWN .gitignore. This root file adds the
#       root-level boundary and covers patterns repo-wide. gitignore
#       NEVER affects already-tracked files — it only blocks NEW adds.
# ============================================================

# ----- Secrets / local environment -----
.env
*.env
*.env.local

# ----- Runtime database + backups -----
# IMPORTANT: the runtime DB backups `zhuangzhou.db.bak_*` do NOT end in
# `.db`, so the `*.db` rule in zhuangzhou-ui/.gitignore does NOT cover
# them. These two patterns close that leak (verified NOT-IGNORED before).
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.db.bak*
zhuangzhou.db.bak*

# ----- Logs / temp / cache -----
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
.cache/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ----- Local data / user data -----
data/
user-data/
launcher/logs/

# ----- Dependencies / managed runtimes (not source) -----
node_modules/
python/
models/
launcher/electron-bin/

# ----- Build / dist artifacts -----
dist/
build/
electron/dist/

# ----- IDE / OS -----
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# ----- Secrets hardening (P0-E augmentation, 2026-08-14) -----
# Proactive block added before the first remote push (P0-I/J). The only
# live secret is zhuangzhou-ui/.env (already covered by `*.env` above).
# These patterns close common leak vectors that `*.env` does NOT catch.
# (Minimal change: no existing rule above was modified.)
*.p12
*.pfx
*.keystore
*.jks
*.key
id_rsa*
id_dsa*
id_ecdsa*
id_ed25519*
credentials*.json
service-account*.json
client_secret*.json
*.secret

# ----- P0 baseline hygiene (2026-08-14) -----
# Isolated corrupted .git kept on disk for forensics (P0-D rename, NOT deleted);
# exclude from the clean baseline so the new repo stays small and healthy.
.git.corrupted-backup-*
# WorkBuddy project tooling metadata (regenerable, not product source).
.workbuddy/

# ----- 2026-08-16 增补 -----
# 玄岱清理回收区（可恢复档案，不入库）
_recycle_safety/
# UI 验收截图（可再生成）
zz-space/_verify/
*.png.aiboy.bak
*.png.prev.bak
# 归档的旧 UI（2026-08-16 迁移，磁盘保留不入库）
zhuangzhou-ui/_legacy/

# ----- R8 Release Closure: runtime artifacts (never committed) -----
*.pid
logs/execution_trace/
*.jsonl
third_party/UFO/
/third_party/UFO/
